Screen:
| nice_cpu      V9.9                            the 32-bit NICE CPU of B. Ulmann
| F1 typewriter   F3 key codes   F5 charset   F7 counters   F9 comet   F11 board
|
|  This is the demo of the NICE CPU. What you type on the keyboard, or send to
|  the console, appears below the blue bar. The function keys start the demos.
|
|  It runs in niceemu --window, and on a board that keeps it in its ROM. The
|  assembler, the emulator, the C library, and the FPGA cores are at
|  https://github.com/MJoergen/nice_cpu
| RETURN new line   DEL delete   cursor keys move   CTRL-L clear   F12 return
|Hello, world!
|aX      Y
|Q1234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789
|abRde
